{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Arcade Classic Returns!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An arcade classic returns with a full-on sequel to the original brick-breaker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re Blippy\u2014the heroic paddle\u2014back to defend planet Earth from a new threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Little Snarfers are here, and the challenge ramps up fast across over 40 brand-new levels. Smash through brick patterns, stay alive under pressure, and lean on classic power-ups to keep your run going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the full game and you\u2019ll earn brand-new ending cutscenes\u2014if you can finish what you started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 40 brand-new challenging levels to complete</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Blippy, the heroic paddle</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuation of the heroic storyline from the original</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic power-ups to swing tough stages your way</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New additional small bricks for tighter, trickier clears</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle the new threat: The Little Snarfers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock brand-new ending cutscenes by completing the game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gamepad Support</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1450660?t=1770996430","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1450660/756411d136b0e11fa9cafd17318e32b7d9493d39/page_bg_raw.jpg?